{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120519","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120519/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120519/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120519/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120519","id":4710902298,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7o4Om-","number":120519,"title":"GLTF: Don't unnecessarily pass around the path internally","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-21T15:00:01Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T22:38:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120519","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120519.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120519.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"In the glTF code, when calling the public exposed functions, the path information is set into the p_state right away:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nError GLTFDocument::write_to_filesystem(Ref<GLTFState> p_state, const String &p_path) {\r\n\tERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_state.is_null(), ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER);\r\n\tp_state->set_base_path(p_path.get_base_dir());\r\n\tp_state->filename = p_path.get_file();\r\n```\r\n\r\nYet for some reason, the path was passed around as well. In most cases, this full path parameter was being unnecessarily split up repeatedly, such as here in the buffer code where it calls `get_basename()` and `get_base_dir()`\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nString filename = p_path.get_basename().get_file() + itos(i) + \".bin\";\r\nString path = p_path.get_base_dir() + \"/\" + filename;\r\n```\r\n\r\nI replaced that code with this (and use `const`, and use `path_join`, and prefix the names with `bin_`):\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nconst String bin_filename = p_state->filename.get_basename() + itos(i) + \".bin\";\r\nconst String bin_path = p_state->base_path.path_join(bin_filename);\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso, this PR:\r\n\r\n- Fixes an issue where `GLTFDocument::_parse_json` was completely dead code that wasn't used anywhere. The dead function has been deleted.\r\n- Fixes a bug where the FBX code was stripping the file extension from `p_state->filename` using `get_basename()`. The shared glTF code expects it to contain the file extension. It seems like the only FBX-specific usage site is this code which strips it, so the FBX parts should already work either way:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nString file_path = p_state->get_base_path().path_join(p_state->filename.get_basename() + \"_\" + p_image->get_name());\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120519/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}